In the quest to discover and re-discover fun places to eat in Newport Beach and Costa Mesa, this week's feature is the Seasons 52 at South Coast Plaza, 3333 Bristol Street, Suite 2802, Costa Mesa.
Near Bloomingdales and right below Capital Grill, Seasons 52 has both self-parking and valet available, making this an easy place to dine.
The patio has tables for dining as well as cushy chairs for those just in the mood for cocktails, and is pet friendly.
